---
const action=import.meta.env.PUBLIC_NEWSLETTER_ACTION || '';
---
<section id="newsletter" class="newsletter"><div><p class="eyebrow">SOMETHING NEW · THE NEWFAVORITE NEWSLETTER</p><h2>A new reason to cook</h2><p>One ingredient, one technique, or one recipe worth trying. Delivered to your inbox.</p></div>{action ? <form action={action} method="post" target="_blank"><label class="sr-only" for="email">Email address</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="Your email address" required autocomplete="email"/><button type="submit" data-track="newsletter_submit">Subscribe ↗</button></form> : <div class="newsletter-note">Newsletter signup coming soon. Set <code>PUBLIC_NEWSLETTER_ACTION</code> to your provider's hosted form endpoint.</div>}</section>
